    "DisplayDescription": "Hockrow Agency \nCase File #BR56263\nLead Investigator: Arken Mallor\n\nCase Summary: \nNeed an operative to extract the blackbox from a destroyed ship. The ship\u2019s owner claims that it was genuinely lost in an outlaw attack, but the insurance company has doubts. We\u2019ve been hired to find out which is true.\n\nI suspect that the perpetrators are long gone by now, so you shouldn't run into any resistance.\n\nContract Investigator Actions:\nProceed to <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4>, secure the black box in the derelict spaceship there and return it to <EM4>[Destination|Target|Address]</EM4>.\n\nAdditional Notes:\nYou will need to EVA for this one so make sure you got a suit.",
